WEBVTT

00:02:57.924 --> 00:03:00.843
So now the ancient wisdom,

00:03:00.885 --> 00:03:04.180
which is key to stewardship,

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:08.100
is locked in the older,
disappearing generations.

00:03:08.726 --> 00:03:13.814
And so we started this journey
to bring back these stories

00:03:13.856 --> 00:03:17.735
as an effort to restore
pride and ownership.

00:03:18.194 --> 00:03:22.949
Oral storytelling has always
played a fundamental role,

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:26.827
not only in African culture
but in conservation efforts, too.

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:29.622
We also do mapping exercises

00:03:29.664 --> 00:03:35.294
to help villagers visualize the influence
and impact not only of their land,